speaker: guard
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: all_in
---
//START: reactaction03
Guard: [auto/] All in! Now that — that is the kind of reckless bravery I used to see on the front lines. Not that I was on the front lines. I was more of a... coordinator.
//END: reactaction03
===

title: Guard_ReactAction_Raise_02
tags: react_action
speaker: guard
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: raise
---
//START: reactaction04
