//END: reactaction04
===

title: Guard_ReactAction_Check_01
tags: react_action
speaker: guard
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: check
---
//START: reactaction05
Guard: [auto/] Checking? How measured. How cautious. I crush those who cling to caution.
//END: reactaction05
===

title: Guard_ReactAction_Call_01
tags: react_action
speaker: guard
category: react_action
target: any
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: call
---
//START: reactaction06
Guard: [auto/] A call. Measured. Unremarkable. I have called far larger sums in far grander rooms.
//END: reactaction06
===

title: Guard_ReactAction_SelfFold_01
tags: react_action
speaker: guard
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: fold
---
//START: reactaction07
Guard: [auto/] I fold not from weakness but from foresight. A leader who cannot see when to withdraw is no leader at all. I read- wrote that.
//END: reactaction07
===

title: Guard_ReactAction_SelfAllIn_01
tags: react_action
speaker: guard
category: react_action
target: self
phase: any
requires:
priority: 1
react_to: all_in
---
//START: reactaction08
Guard: [auto/] All in! Yes! This is the kind of decisive command I was known for.
//END: reactaction08
===

title: Guard_ReactAction_SelfRaise_01
